     {
      "pClass": "productdescription",
      "pText": "Apex is a tepee-shaped play tower in Baby Blue from the Pinnacle series of our NexLev range. Its hexagonal tower carries a tube slide, a net tunnel climber leads up one side and a trail of stepping posts runs across the ground in front. Children hop the posts, crawl up the tunnel and come down the slide, a simple loop that a group can repeat. It holds 30 to 35 children. Plan for a product area of 24'10\" x 22'7\" and a safe play area of 30'10\" x 28'7\". The listed skills are strength, team building, hand and eye coordination and concentration. A housing society or school with a squarish lawn will find it easy to place. Its galvanised pipe, roto-moulded parts, composite laminates and play rope carry our standard 3-year warranty. Write to sales@funplaysystems.com for a layout drawing."
     }
